>> was whether xname() was the right function to use, which it seems to 
>> be, but I have insufficient familiarity to know if there might be a 
>> better. Someone else, no doubt, will correct me if that's the case.
> 
> I've never tried patching or installing them, can you give me the very 
> short course on how to put this into my very vanilla version?

First, get the source code from nethack.org.  Then, follow the 
instructions that come with it to compile the unmodified version on your 
system (really just for practice, but probably for the best).  Once you 
can get the unmodified source code to compile, use a patching utility to 
apply the patch to the source code, then re-compile exactly as you did 
before.  This all may be harder than it sounds.

